    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/0a4a83c1339a6d1a934b79e3dd53aec9.poster.avif?t=1751630699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/0a4a83c1339a6d1a934b79e3dd53aec9.webm?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/0a4a83c1339a6d1a934b79e3dd53aec9.mp4?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Welcome to Zekertune, where every beat matters and every melody tells a story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an immersive and vibrant world of music with Zekertune, a rhythm game designed to test your precision, reflexes, and love for music. Whether you're a beginner just discovering the genre or a hardcore veteran seeking the ultimate challenge, Zekertune offers a satisfying experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEEL THE RHYTHM, MASTER THE MUSIC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/30416d4ea3450da36258de82dffb6bec.poster.avif?t=1751630699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/30416d4ea3450da36258de82dffb6bec.webm?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/30416d4ea3450da36258de82dffb6bec.mp4?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zekertune\u2019s core gameplay is simple to learn but incredibly hard to master. Notes will fall from the top of the screen, and your task is to hit the right keys at the perfect time to create beautiful harmony. Chain long combos to multiply your score and fill up your \u201cZekert Gauge\u201d to unleash an explosive score fever! Every song is a journey, and only those with perfect synchronization will reach the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Extensive &amp; Diverse Music Library</strong><br>Enjoy a growing collection  tracks from various genres including EDM, J-Pop, Rock, DJ Remixes, Acoustic, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb9 <strong>Intuitive &amp; Responsive Gameplay System</strong><br>With precise controls and clear visual feedback, you\u2019ll feel every beat. Adjust note speed, offset, and other settings to create the most comfortable gameplay experience for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Dynamic Challenges for Everyone</strong><br>From the relaxing Easy mode to the finger-burning Zekert-Master difficulty. Zekertune ensures there's always a new challenge waiting. Complete songs to unlock higher difficulty levels and hidden charts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Note Skins<br>Make Zekertune truly yours! Unlock and choose from a variety of note skins, visual note effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global  Leaderboards</strong><br>Compete with friends and players from around the world! Prove your skill by climbing to the top of the leaderboard for each song and difficulty level. Who is the ultimate Tuner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to prove your skills and become a rhythm legend?</strong><br>Add Zekertune to your Wishlist now and get ready to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/0a4a83c1339a6d1a934b79e3dd53aec9.poster.avif?t=1751630699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/0a4a83c1339a6d1a934b79e3dd53aec9.webm?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/0a4a83c1339a6d1a934b79e3dd53aec9.mp4?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Welcome to Zekertune, where every beat matters and every melody tells a story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an immersive and vibrant world of music with Zekertune, a rhythm game designed to test your precision, reflexes, and love for music. Whether you're a beginner just discovering the genre or a hardcore veteran seeking the ultimate challenge, Zekertune offers a satisfying experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEEL THE RHYTHM, MASTER THE MUSIC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/30416d4ea3450da36258de82dffb6bec.poster.avif?t=1751630699\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/30416d4ea3450da36258de82dffb6bec.webm?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822960/extras/30416d4ea3450da36258de82dffb6bec.mp4?t=1751630699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zekertune\u2019s core gameplay is simple to learn but incredibly hard to master. Notes will fall from the top of the screen, and your task is to hit the right keys at the perfect time to create beautiful harmony. Chain long combos to multiply your score and fill up your \u201cZekert Gauge\u201d to unleash an explosive score fever! Every song is a journey, and only those with perfect synchronization will reach the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Extensive &amp; Diverse Music Library</strong><br>Enjoy a growing collection  tracks from various genres including EDM, J-Pop, Rock, DJ Remixes, Acoustic, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb9 <strong>Intuitive &amp; Responsive Gameplay System</strong><br>With precise controls and clear visual feedback, you\u2019ll feel every beat. Adjust note speed, offset, and other settings to create the most comfortable gameplay experience for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Dynamic Challenges for Everyone</strong><br>From the relaxing Easy mode to the finger-burning Zekert-Master difficulty. Zekertune ensures there's always a new challenge waiting. Complete songs to unlock higher difficulty levels and hidden charts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Note Skins<br>Make Zekertune truly yours! Unlock and choose from a variety of note skins, visual note effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global  Leaderboards</strong><br>Compete with friends and players from around the world! Prove your skill by climbing to the top of the leaderboard for each song and difficulty level. Who is the ultimate Tuner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to prove your skills and become a rhythm legend?</strong><br>Add Zekertune to your Wishlist now and get ready to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Zekertune is the music rhythm game that will put your reflexes and sense of rhythm to the ultimate test! Dive into an immersive world of music where every tap counts.",
